Attach a new file resource to a board element.

SOURCE may be:
  - a local filesystem path
  - a file:// URL
  - an http:// or https:// URL

Examples:
  task-board resource add TASK-260311-abc ./screenshot.png --type precondition
  task-board resource add TASK-260311-abc file:///tmp/report.pdf --name ui-report.pdf
  task-board resource add TASK-260311-abc ./report.md --name reports/review/report.md
  task-board resource add TASK-260311-abc https://example.com/spec.pdf --type outcome

Usage:
  task-board resource add <ELEMENT-ID> <SOURCE> [flags]

Flags:
  -d, --description string   Optional one-line description
  -h, --help                 help for add
      --name string          Override stored resource filename
      --type string          Resource type: precondition or outcome (default "outcome")

Global Flags:
      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default ".task-board")
      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite
      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)
      --json                     Output in JSON format
      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check
      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)
      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)

